    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/4fa1f58e57ad349cb84a624b41370b46.poster.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/4fa1f58e57ad349cb84a624b41370b46.webm?t=1742839156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/4fa1f58e57ad349cb84a624b41370b46.mp4?t=1742839156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/d426f007222891eaa8faf98ae71d1176.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Queen's Herald and immerse yourself in a <strong>text-based RPG</strong> full of choices and dice rolls. Interact with a diverse cast of characters, each with their own stories to tell and secrets to uncover. Navigate a web of alliances and rivalries as you forge relationships with factions and people throughout The Mists.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/bc095259962768fa7d27a9a005d2e440.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queen\u2019s army is gone, and The Mists hold the answers. Embark on an\u00a0<strong>adventure</strong> <strong>through a mist-shrouded world</strong> and uncover the secrets hidden behind it. Dive into the depths of intrigue and betrayal as you navigate a realm where nothing is as it seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/4ef1ab0ab371cd1b400493e1a715706a.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your destiny through your <strong>choices and actions</strong>. Become a cunning rogue, a masterful mage, a fearless warrior, or something uniquely your own. You are travelling all the time, so what you decide to carry with yourself is equally important. Your decisions will carve your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/7ff84533883034c7fed788d1f997b030.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark fantasy adventure filled with intrigue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Herald with a classless system driven by your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet dozens of unique NPCs to befriend, fight or betray</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the narrative with meaningful choices and branching storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth the truth behind the Queen\u2019s missing army\u2014no matter the cost</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/4fa1f58e57ad349cb84a624b41370b46.poster.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/4fa1f58e57ad349cb84a624b41370b46.webm?t=1742839156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/4fa1f58e57ad349cb84a624b41370b46.mp4?t=1742839156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/d426f007222891eaa8faf98ae71d1176.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Queen's Herald and immerse yourself in a <strong>text-based RPG</strong> full of choices and dice rolls. Interact with a diverse cast of characters, each with their own stories to tell and secrets to uncover. Navigate a web of alliances and rivalries as you forge relationships with factions and people throughout The Mists.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/bc095259962768fa7d27a9a005d2e440.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queen\u2019s army is gone, and The Mists hold the answers. Embark on an\u00a0<strong>adventure</strong> <strong>through a mist-shrouded world</strong> and uncover the secrets hidden behind it. Dive into the depths of intrigue and betrayal as you navigate a realm where nothing is as it seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/4ef1ab0ab371cd1b400493e1a715706a.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your destiny through your <strong>choices and actions</strong>. Become a cunning rogue, a masterful mage, a fearless warrior, or something uniquely your own. You are travelling all the time, so what you decide to carry with yourself is equally important. Your decisions will carve your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972310/extras/7ff84533883034c7fed788d1f997b030.avif?t=1742839156\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark fantasy adventure filled with intrigue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Herald with a classless system driven by your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet dozens of unique NPCs to befriend, fight or betray</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the narrative with meaningful choices and branching storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth the truth behind the Queen\u2019s missing army\u2014no matter the cost</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A narrative-driven RPG where every dice roll shapes your fate. Step into the role of the Queen's Herald and traverse a mist-shrouded realm to uncover the fate of her lost army. Will your choices uphold loyalty, or lead you down a path of betrayal? The secrets of the mists await.",
